{{#is_alert}}
## What's happening?
`pipelines.source_buffer_utilization_mean` stopped reporting for pipeline `{{pipeline_name.name}}` on `{{host.name}}`. OPW stops emitting this metric once the source buffer is completely full, so absence can mean total saturation rather than a dead pod. Check the source buffer saturation monitor and worker liveness together before concluding the worker is gone.
{{/is_alert}}
{{#is_recovery}}The source buffer metric is reporting again for `{{pipeline_name.name}}` on `{{host.name}}`.{{/is_recovery}}

